    {
      "bio": "An internist raised in Santa Clarita Valley, Anil Ravi Date, MD completed medical school at Ross University School of Medicine (graduated June 2007), followed by residency in Internal Medicine at Flushing Hospital, Queens, NY, and fellowship in Geriatric Medicine. He practiced one year as a hospitalist in Arizona before returning to Southern California, practicing inpatient and outpatient medicine at Antelope Valley Hospital for over three years. He now provides comprehensive internal and geriatric medicine at SCV Medical Group, serving a broad spectrum of illnesses.",
